{"ID":"20230927160210-rrtgon3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927160210-rrtgon3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160210-rrtgon3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160213-7n9h7tn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160213-o56q5u9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160213-o56q5u9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:38,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:38\u0026#125;","title":"【阳和汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927160213"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927160213-7n9h7tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160213-7n9h7tn","updated":"20230927160213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳和汤[方源]《外科证治全生集》"}]},{"ID":"20230927160213-0mwkeim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160213-0mwkeim","updated":"20230927160213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[组成] 熟地一两(30g) 肉桂一钱，去皮，研粉(3g) 麻黄五分(2g) 鹿角胶三钱 (9g)白芥子二钱(6g) 姜炭五分(2g) 生甘草一钱 (3g)"}]},{"ID":"20230927160213-rv2smyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160213-rv2smyv","updated":"20230927160213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[用法]以上八味共为细末，开水送服一钱(3g)，日二次。临床效果胜过水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20230927160213-qgkvlnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160213-qgkvlnq","updated":"20230927160213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" [用法]水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20230927160213-o56q5u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160213-o56q5u9","updated":"20230927160213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" [方歌] 阳和汤法解寒凝，贴骨流注鹤膝风，熟地鹿胶姜炭桂，麻黄白芥甘草从。"}]}]}